WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.460
A gaslit London street.

2
00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:06.020
Then the fog rolls in, thick and brown.

3
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:09.830
"A great chocolate-coloured
pall lowered over heaven".

4
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.710
A cab's lamps glow, and vanish.

5
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.060
A door with no knocker
appears, and is swallowed.

6
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:19.380
Chapter after chapter, the fog comes back.

7
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.840
So why does it never seem to lift?

8
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:26.280
In this mission, you'll see how Stevenson
moves the Gothic out of castles and

9
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.970
into a modern city.

10
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.240
You'll ride with a lawyer's cab into Soho,

11
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:32.630
through every shade of twilight.

12
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.760
And you'll meet a
building with a forehead,

13
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:36.260
but no eyes.

14
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:40.460
Your mission: work out why the
fog never lifts on this London.
